    'desc' => 'Travelling Delhi to Manali by overnight Volvo bus: how long it takes, how to sleep, what to carry and how our Volvo packages are arranged.',
    'lead' => 'The overnight Volvo is the most popular budget way to reach Manali from Delhi. A little preparation makes it far more comfortable.',
